# Walk-In Closet: "You may play lands from your graveyard" (CR 305.1), a standing rule of the Room while this door is
# unlocked (CR 709.5). Bot1 casts the door, then in turn 3 sacrifices Strip Mine and plays it again from the graveyard.
# The rule is only about lands: Black Lotus, also in the graveyard, is not cast from there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Black Lotus
Walk-In Closet // Forgotten Cellar
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Walk-In Closet // Forgotten Cellar.Cast(Ability: Walk-In Closet)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Island; Ability: Destroy)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Strip Mine; Black Lotus
! Bot1.Graveyard.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Graveyard.Strip Mine.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Walk-In Closet; Strip Mine
Bot1.Battlefield.Walk-In Closet.Doors = Walk-In Closet
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Island
